* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_disp (reference/crafted.toml, 14 Nov 2026): linear dispatching
* (eqactups.vda L9-117; Version.log 3.7.0 and 3.9.0), added to TIMES_Demo demo12
* (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). No unit commitment by start-up type
* (eqlducs.vda): that is demo12_uc.
* - REG1 ELCTEGAS00 (not vintaged): the dispatching records of demo12_uc's uc.dd, unchanged:
*   ramping (ACT_UPS UP/LO), minimum stable load (ACT_UPS FX, ACT_MINLD), partial-load
*   efficiency loss (ACT_LOSPL FX), start-up cost at DAYNITE (ACT_CSTUP), minimum on-line and
*   off-line hours and a cycle limit (ACT_TIME UP/LO/N), ramping costs (ACT_CSTRMP).
* - REG2 ELCTNGAS01 (vintaged, PRC_VINT): minimum stable load and a ramp-up limit only
*   (ACT_UPS FX/UP), start-up cost at SEASON (ACT_CSTUP), a partial-load cost (ACT_CSTPL, which
*   becomes ACT_CSTUP at ANNUAL), an explicit ACT_LOSPL UP with no FX, a cycle limit (ACT_TIME N).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
ACT_UPS ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.UP 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.LO 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.FX 0.25
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ANNUAL.FX 0.35
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ANNUAL.UP 0.4

/

PARAMETER
ACT_MINLD ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00 0.3

/

PARAMETER
ACT_LOSPL ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.FX 0.1
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.UP 0.7

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTUP ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.DAYNITE.MEURO05 0.02
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.SEASON.MEURO05 0.03

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTPL ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.MEURO05 0.5

/

PARAMETER
ACT_TIME ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.UP 6
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.LO 6
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.N 200
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.N 100

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTRMP ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.UP.MEURO05 0.001
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.LO.MEURO05 0.001

/
